{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into the dangerous underworld, keep moving forward in the underworld, and the devil will constantly summon various monsters to stop players. Players need to prepare weapon combinations in advance, summon and put away weapon groups at any time in the battle to deal with all crises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will bring a real-time combat experience full of strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a RogueLike game, with a wealth of different kinds of props, each of which will have a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of props: weapons, enchantments (enhanced weapons), passive items, amulets, consumables, etc. Their combination will form a variety of genres, which will bring a unique experience to each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[about DEMO]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preemptive experience provides a demonstration of the core gameplay mechanism of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first experience includes about 30 different weapons and 40 different props (they will have a lot of different combination effects)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-provide endless modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The art resources of the game will be replaced in the official version)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501590?t=1763224943","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501590?t=1763224943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset